  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "System/DateTime.ToString(String) node has three overloaded variant in its dropdown menu\n- (string)\n- (IFormatProvider)\n- (string, IFormatProvider)\nWhen choosing first one (string), there is not input slot (connection point) for string argument.\nVersion:\nUDONSDK-2019.12.22.12.32\nVRCSDK3-2019.12.21.16.01\n\nActually, DateTime has four overloaded variant. So there's another issue that one variant is missing. In another words, dropdown menu label is wrong. This is for no argument variant. And implementation for '(string)' is missing.",
